From c0fa69760763046bde51c481d1f22e251957e355 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mingcong Bai <jeffbai@aosc.io>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:44:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(metadata.json): set EnabledByDefault to true
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This property controls whether the Plasmoid is to be enabled by default on
installation, enable it here since it is considered standard feature.

This commit is authored with assistance from AI/LLM:

- Model: DeepSeek-V41-Flash
- Agent platform: DeepSeek Harness (https://www.deepseek.com/en/harness/)
- Prompt:
  为什么 plasma-aosc-updates (io.aosc.plasmaaoscupdates.updates) 托盘图标在默认安装后会被 KDE 默认设置为“已禁用”？
---
 plasmoid/metadata.json | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/plasmoid/metadata.json b/plasmoid/metadata.json
index 88b94a5..78513e1 100644
--- a/plasmoid/metadata.json
+++ b/plasmoid/metadata.json
@@ -32,7 +32,8 @@
             }
         ],
         "Version": "1.0",
-        "Website": ""
+        "Website": "",
+        "EnabledByDefault": true
     },
     "X-Plasma-API-Minimum-Version": "6.0",
     "X-Plasma-NotificationAreaCategory": "SystemServices",
-- 
2.56.0

